On Tue, 26 Aug 2003, mjstumpf wrote:

> 1)  Any suggestions for dampening vibrations?  I'd like to use those huge
> blue rubber grommets, but I can't really find enough anywhere..

For the grommets (black only), try an auto parts store.  These would be
best when used with a shoulder screw.  Both of these components are used
in the Antec Sonata case, but aren't on their web page.  You might be able
to call them, and order some.

